From e48f8fe9d3a1ad812eb680f1953757c8f0e710d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:17:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(outcomes): strategy outcome log follows the state
 directory, not the working directory

outcome_logger and outcome_summary used a path relative to the working
directory and ignored CBP_STATE_DIR. Campaigns with their own state
directories wrote one shared file (the closed-trade summary then read one
campaign's realized total as a change from another's), a process started
elsewhere used a different file, and every test run appended to the real one.

Both modules now resolve the file from the state directory on each call. For
the default state directory started from the repo root it is the same file.

Recorded by test, not changed: outcome evidence cannot change which strategy
the selector picks (score clamped to +/-3, rank steps of 10).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
