+  influence selection is an operator decision.
+- NOT changed: rows already in the shared file stay there, mixed (no
+  history is cleared or split); a campaign with its own state directory
+  starts a new file and no longer sees them. Four other paths are still
+  relative to the working directory and are pinned as known by a test:
